<DTA TYPE="STRING">(2) Max temperature may be increased to<MET> 190 degrees C</MET><ENG> 375 degrees F</ENG> if recommended by the manufacturer to facilitate uniform application free of equipment clogging issues when hard base asphalt is used.</DTA>
